OL,3,GNEWSAGas bills to rise as Middle East
OL,4,Aturmoil persists
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas customers in Jersey will see their
OL,7,Fbills increase by about 5% from 1
OL,8,FDecember after Island Energy announced
OL,9,Fa rise in tariffs for households and
OL,10,Fbusinesses.
OL,12,FThe company said its mains gas, mini
OL,13,Fbulk tank and cylinder tariffs would
OL,14,Fincrease by 1p per kilowatt hour (kWh)
OL,15,Ffor all domestic and commercial
OL,16,Fcustomers from 1 December 2026.
OL,18,FIt said the increase reflected higher
OL,19,Fwholesale gas and liquefied petroleum
OL,20,Fgas costs amid disruption to exports
OL,21,Fand shipping routes in the Middle East
OL,22,Fafter the conflict with Iran.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
